WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Service providers are women-owned businesses that offer a service, verified just like brands.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Open The Switch, then the Providers tab.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The list shows each provider, whether she's a draft or live, and whether she's verified.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Press Add provider.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Type the business name.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Choose the kind of service.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
List what she does.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Add her story, using only what she wrote or approved.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Then where she works: her city and state.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
And her website, so shoppers can reach her.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.500
Ownership details are for admins only, and they're needed to publish.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Published stays greyed out until everything is in. The line under it tells you exactly what's missing.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Enter the owner's full name.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.000
The date you checked.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.000
The kind of evidence.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
And where you saw it.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Now every requirement is met, so Published can be ticked.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Press Add.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:12.000
And she's in the list, live and verified. In this demo, nothing really went live.
